e.g.:
```java
class VerboseUser implements User {
  private final User users;
  private final Logger log;
  
  public void authorize(String token) {
    this.users.authorize(token);
    log.info("User %d (%s) authorized by token", this.uid(), urn)
  }
}
```

What do you think?

